      "bbox": {
        "l": 55.8425,
        "t": 298.9594068359375,
        "r": 196.10569999999993,
        "b": 289.04384920353874
      },
      "content": "Remove battery B+ cable.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_302",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_4",
          "title": "4. Engine Control Service"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_302",
          "title": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)"
        }
      ],
      "page": 22,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0295",
      "reading_order": 304,
      "section": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 55.8425,
        "t": 273.7309068359375,
        "r": 250.84720000000007,
        "b": 263.81534920353874
      },
      "content": "Place ohmmeter leads across switch.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_302",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_4",
          "title": "4. Engine Control Service"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_302",
          "title": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)"
        }
      ],
      "page": 22,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0296",
      "reading_order": 305,
      "section": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 329.2156,
        "t": 737.9892068359376,
        "r": 564.9499999999991,
        "b": 664.8621492035389
      },
      "content": "Open  and  close  switch  while  observing  the ohmmeter.    A  normally  open  (NO)  switch should indicate infinite resistance when open and continuity when closed.   A normally closed (NC)  switch  should  indicate  continuity  when closed and infinite resistance when open.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_302",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_4",
          "title": "4. Engine Control Service"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_302",
          "title": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)"
        }
      ],
      "page": 22,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0297",
      "reading_order": 306,
      "section": "START/STOP SWITCH CHECK (S11)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 329.2156,
        "t": 652.0440068359377,
        "r": 475.23949999999985,
        "b": 642.1284492035389
      },
      "content": "Replace switch if defective.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_302",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_4",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_4",
          "title": "4. Engine Control Service"
        },
